omputed combinations (one per monomial) |\n| `headers` | `MonomialHeader*` | `num_monomials` | Array of monomial metadata |\n| `terms` | `InteractionMonomialTerm*` | `sum(num_terms)` | Flattened interaction terms for all monomials |\n| `beta_pows` | `FpExt*` | `max_interaction_len + 1` | Powers of beta (sampled challenge) |\n| `eq_3bs` | `FpExt*` | `num_interactions` | Pre-evaluated eq(xi, 3*b) for each interaction |\n| `num_monomials` | `u32` | 1 | Total monomial count for this AIR |\n\n**MonomialHeader structure (12 bytes):**\n```cpp\nstruct MonomialHeader {\n  uint32_t var_offset;      // Start index in d_variables array\n  uint32_t term_offset;     // Start index in terms array (InteractionMonomialTerm)\n  uint16_t num_vars;        // Number of variables in this monomial\n  uint16_t num_terms;       // Number of terms for this monomial\n}\n```\n\n**InteractionMonomialTerm structure (8 bytes):**\n```cpp\nstruct InteractionMonomialTerm {\n  Fp coefficient;           // Per-term coefficient\n  uint16_t interaction_idx; // Index into eq_3bs\n  uint16_t field_idx;       // For denom: index into beta_pows. For numer: unused.\n}\n```\n\n#### Kernel Implementation:\n**File**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu` lines 303-327\n\n```cuda\n__global__ void precompute_logup_combinations_kernel<bool IS_DENOM>(\n    FpExt *out,\n    const MonomialHeader *headers,\n    const InteractionMonomialTerm *terms,\n    const FpExt *beta_pows,\n    const FpExt *eq_3bs,\n    uint32_t num_monomials\n) {\n    uint32_t m = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;\n    if (m >= num_monomials) return;\n    \n    MonomialHeader hdr = headers[m];\n    FpExt sum(Fp::zero());\n    for (uint16_t t = 0; t < hdr.num_terms; ++t) {\n        InteractionMonomialTerm term = terms[hdr.term_offset + t];\n        FpExt value = eq_3bs[term.interaction_idx] * term.coefficient;\n        if constexpr (IS_DENOM) {\n            value *= beta_pows[term.field