{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01CUobZRftkkREsAFz3aEovQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Current performance summary at APC 300 vs baseline:\n\n| Metric | Baseline | Current | Improvement |\n|--------|----------|---------|-------------|\n| STARK excl trace | 2455ms | 1327ms | 1.85x |\n| LogUp GKR | 790ms | 521ms | 1.52x |\n| Round 0 | 662ms | 202ms | 3.28x |\n| MLE Rounds | 180ms | 170ms | 1.06x |\n| Trace Commit | 406ms | 254ms | 1.60x |\n| Stacked Reduction | 311ms | 74ms | 4.20x |\n| WHIR | 100ms | 99ms | 1.01x |\n\nAPC 0: 2147ms (vs baseline 2153ms — no regression). Scaling ratio: 2147/1327 = 1.62x. Goal: >2x.\n\n**Key findings from profiling and code research:**\n\n1. The `precompute_logup_combinations` step (1582 kernel launches, 37ms GPU time) runs sequentially on the default stream BEFORE Round 0 starts, but its output is only needed for MLE rounds. It's on the critical path unnecessarily.\n\n2. The d_eq_3b_per_trace uploads (791 small H2D copies, ~5-8ms) also run before Round 0 but are only needed by the precompute.\n\n3. Round 0 multi-stream evaluation uses HOST-side eq_3bs for weight computation, NOT the device-side buffers. The precompute and Round 0 have zero data dependencies.\n\n4. Round 0 multi-stream evaluation takes ~155ms. The precompute + uploads total ~45ms. Both fit on the GPU concurrently (Round 0 GPU utilization is only ~42%).\n\n**Optimization Ideas:**\n\n**Idea 1: Overlap logup combination precompute with Round 0 evaluation**\nMove the d_eq_3b upload + precompute_logup_combinations calls to a background thread running concurrently with Round 0 multi-stream evaluation. The precompute (45ms) is fully hidden behind Round 0 (155ms).\n- Expected impact: ~35-45ms at APC 300\n- Probability: High (no kernel changes, clean data independence)\n- Complexity: Simple (spawn thread, join after Round 0)\n\n**Idea 2: Batch precompute_logup_combinations into descriptor-array kernels**\nReplace 1582 per-trace kernel launches with 2 batched launches.\n- Expected impact: ~15-20ms from reduced launch overhead\n- Probability: High (proven pattern)\n- Complexity: Moderate (new CUDA kernel + descriptor arrays)\n\n**Idea 3: Batch + overlap combined**\nBatch the precompute into 2 launches AND overlap with Round 0.\n- Expected impact: ~40-45ms (hiding the batched precompute entirely)\n- Probability: High\n- Complexity: Moderate\n\n**Idea 4: Multi-stream Trace Commit stacking groups**\nRun Poseidon2 leaf hashing for different stacking groups on separate streams.\n- Expected impact: ~30-50ms if smaller groups can overlap with larger ones\n- Probability: Medium (uncertain GPU saturation)\n- Complexity: Complex\n\n**Idea 5: Reduce GKR input eval per-AIR overhead**\nPre-compute weight arrays (numer_weights, denom_weights) for GKR input eval at keygen time.\n- Expected impact: ~50-75ms (reducing per-AIR overhead)\n- Probability: Medium (previous similar approach for Round 0 had 0ms impact)\n- Complexity: Moderate\n\n**Ranking (impact × probability / complexity):**\n1. Idea 1: (40 × 0.85) / 1 = **34** ← Best effort-to-impact ratio\n2. Idea 3: (42 × 0.8) / 2 = **16.8**\n3. Idea 2: (17 × 0.85) / 2 = **7.2**\n4. Idea 5: (62 × 0.5) / 2 = **15.5**\n5. Idea 4: (40 × 0.5) / 3 = **6.7**\n\n**Selected: Idea 1 — Overlap logup combination precompute with Round 0.**\n\nNow let me write the task and plan."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8091,"cache_read_input_tokens":146015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8091},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ff03fa2a-06a9-4cae-9336-eb9eb1af38e2","uuid":"5163e117-4f75-4d2f-965c-e143f8eb37fd"}
