ach call launches 2 GPU kernels (`precompute_logup_numer_combinations` + `precompute_logup_denom_combinations`). 1582 total kernel launches, 37ms GPU time. NOT needed for Round 0, only for MLE rounds.\n5. **Lines 977-1002**: eq_xis + sels_per_trace_base (needed for Round 0 work items)\n6. **Lines 1014-1137**: Work item construction, sorting, extract tables, batch array\n7. **Line 1192-1194**: `current_stream_sync()` barrier\n8. **Lines 1196+**: Round 0 multi-stream evaluation (~155ms, 8 threads)\n\nSteps 3-4 total ~45ms and are independent of steps 5-8. Round 0 GPU utilization is ~42%, leaving ample capacity for concurrent precompute kernels.\n\n**Data dependency analysis:**\n\n| Data | Used by Round 0? | Used by precompute? | Conflict? |\n|------|-------------------|---------------------|-----------|\n| `self.pk` | Yes (shared &) | Yes (shared &) | No (both read-only) |\n| `self.eq_3b_per_trace` (host) | Yes (work items borrow `&[EF]`) | Yes (read for upload + CPU bus_term_sum) | No (both read-only) |\n| `self.d_eq_3b_per_trace` (device) | No | Yes (written by upload) | No conflict |\n| `self.d_beta_pows` | No (Round 0 uses host-side `beta_pows`) | Yes (read by precompute kernels) | No |\n| `self.logup_combinations` | No | Yes (written by precompute) | No conflict |\n| `self.beta_pows` (host) | Yes (work items borrow `&[EF]`) | Yes (read for bus_term_sum CPU computation) | No (both read-only) |\n\n## Changes\n\n### Change 1: Restructure `sumcheck_uni_round0_polys` to overlap precompute with Round 0\n\n**File**: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`\n\n**What**: Reorder the function body so that steps 3-4 (d_eq_3b upload + logup precompute) run on a background thread concurrent with step 8 (Round 0 multi-stream evaluation).\n\n**New flow**:\n\n```\n1. Lambda powers + lambda combinations            (sequential, same as before)\n2. eq_3b CPU computation → self.eq_3b_per_trace    (sequential, same as before)\n3. eq_xis + sels_per_trace_base                  